rWn6LMduNMXfqIRO7UUZ3D6EH7TF8o?usp=sharing\n---------------------------------------\n構図やシチュエーション、ポーズ等は好きにしていただいて構いません。\n内容や金額が合わない場合は、キャンセルまたは再送要請等をお願いいたします。長文失礼いたしました。\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fwrWn6LMduNMXfqIRO7UUZ3D6EH7TF8o?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 56034, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "かんきつるい🍊Commission Open", "screen_name": "House_of_citrus", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1946432490765201408/ECw5FNwR.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/836057858093404162/1739173269/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 643211, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "だーやま🍤Skeb", "screen_name": "okshutoku", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1748795882500407296/mUh7w4E4.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1199454326/1708449186/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 8}, {"id": 2720001, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Lui", "screen_name": "Meineko_lui", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1970055696474669056/ledoilxv.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1267452775249502209/1746873410/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null,